  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Central Hidroelctrica Porce III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Porce III Hydroelectric Power Plant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Proyecto busca contribuir a la satisfaccin del crecimiento de la demanda de energa y potencia del pas, a partir del segundo semestre de 2010, utilizando los recursos hidrulicos del ro Porce. Adems, busca sustituir generacin trmica, con lo que se pueden liberar recursos no renovables.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will finance the construction of Porce III Hydroelectric Power Plan, owned by Empresas Pblicas de Medelln (EEPPM). The Project is required to satisfy the growth in energy demand in Colombia. Renewable and low-cost resources from the Porce River will be used in a social and environmentally sustainable manner. The Project will finance civil works, electromechanical equipment, transmission lines and an environmental and social management plan.</narrative>
  </description>
